     All diagnostics appear in dialogs: `Cannot open that file',
     `Cannot write that file', `Enter a file name', `Enter text
     to find', `Not found', `Discard unsaved changes?'.

NNOOTTEESS
     The buffer holds at most 1024 lines of at most 240 charac-
     ters.  Loading stops at the line limit, and longer lines are
     split; either event marks the buffer modified so the trunca-
     tion cannot be saved back silently.  The kill buffer holds
     2048 bytes, a search pattern 31 characters, and a file name
     39 characters.  Every line is written back with a trailing


